# Goals from Home on his own goals (the stand-in passes /goals through; its writes never reach hex):
# the grid and its sections, every watch, a project opened, what was reached this week, then a goal
# waiting on him with its answers, a watch with its week and earlier runs and Stop watching, a
# reached goal with Not what I asked and Undo, one hex works on with Not needed and its composer.
# The ids are his as of Nov 16; a reached goal leaves after a week.
launch /
tap Goals
shoot goals
tap goals-more-watching
shoot goals-watching
tap goals-reached
shoot goals-reached
reveal goals-head-projects
tap goals-project-iikb
shoot goals-project-open
launch /goals/t-1128
shoot goal-needs
launch /goals/w/edd-keeper
shoot watch
tap watch-earlier
shoot watch-earlier
tap watch-stop
shoot watch-stopped
launch /goals/t-1135
shoot goal-reached
tap goal-reopen
shoot goal-reopened
tap goal-reopened-undo
shoot goal-undone
launch /goals/t-1139
shoot goal-working
tap goal-drop
shoot goal-dropped
type goal-field Two rooms are fine if it's cheaper
shoot goal-typing
